# Local notes (this machine only — gitignored)

<!--
  Copy this file to CLAUDE.local.md inside each PROJECT worktree
  (not inside claude-personas). Replace the role and absolute path
  below with values for that worktree, then add CLAUDE.local.md to
  your project repo's .gitignore (it contains a machine-specific path).

  Each project worktree gets its own CLAUDE.local.md — same role
  it's pointed at via autoMemoryDirectory, same absolute path.
-->

## Worktree role: <Developer | PM | Designer>

This is the <Role> worktree. claude-personas role memory and behavior rules
are in `autoMemoryDirectory` (loaded automatically at session start).

## claude-personas memory absolute path

Use this prefix with the Read tool when accessing role memory or shared memory:

```
/absolute/path/to/claude-personas/<role>/
```

- Role MEMORY.md: `<above>/MEMORY.md`
- Shared MEMORY.md: `<above>/shared/MEMORY.md` (the `shared/` folder is a symlink to `../shared/`)
